  "prefLabel": "Nur 103.03 Custodian of Records",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nur 103.03 Custodian of Records. The Office of Professional Licensure and Certification is the custodian of the board’s records and responds to requests to examine those portions of the board’s records which are public records.\n\nSource. #6778, eff 6-26-98; ss by #7736, eff 8-6-02; ss by #8777, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10296, eff 3-22-13; ss by #10569, eff 4-17-14; amd by #11144, eff 7-28-16",
